  "title": "Unified Title",
  "summary": "TouchScale provides a 500-hour dataset of contact-rich human interaction recorded with a single wearable setup, offering significant supervision for visual-tactile learning. HuTact, a framework, pretrains tactile-aware hand representations from human hand-object interaction data without requiring real tactile signals during pretraining, enabling scalable robotic tactile learning. Touch-JEPA uses hand-object video to learn tactile representations with limited tactile supervision, providing a scalable alternative to robotic tactile training.",
